{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_tjjf2wmoogr5zguyeasp3hc7iab5dliodmzx74qrin6ekzbzw3eq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've built all four Travelin screens, their components and the launch prototype in **03 · Workspace**. I took a screenshot of every screen, fixed the problems they showed, and checked them again. I didn't change any of the reference pages.\n\n**File:** https://www.figma.com/design/RZd3aqETxqcUig9hSkuYf5/ (signed in as zuohaosheng@tetras.ai)\n**03 · Workspace page ID:** `6:2`\n\n**Screens**\n| Frame | ID | What's on it |\n|---|---|---|\n| 01_Splash | `18:55` | Teal gradient background, centred Logo_Travelin, the tagline \"Your Passport to Seamless Adventures!\" |\n| 02_Get_Started | `18:76` | Full-screen Photo_Aerial_Island with a dark gradient over it, logo, \"English\" language selector, the headline, and the \"Your Journey Starts Here\" button with Icon_Plane |\n| 03_Sign_In | `18:105` | Photo_Hot_Air_Balloons with a white panel over it: logo, \"English\" selector, both headings, empty Email or Phone Number and Password fields, \"Forgot password?\", Sign In, \"or sign in with\", Google, Apple and Facebook buttons, \"Don’t have an account? Sign Up\" |\n| 04_Home | `19:119` (430×1473, scrolls vertically) | \"Hi, Paul\", 2,000 points, cat avatar, \"Where to go?\" search, the flight ticket, the 5 categories, \"Journey together\" with its 3 cards, \"Hotel recommendations for you\" with the Swiss-Belhotel card, and the tab bar with Home as the current tab |\n\nAll copy and data match the brief's fixed data, including the curly apostrophes in \"Let’s\" and \"Don’t\". The ticket shows Upcoming · 24 March 2024 · CGK 05:30 → DPS 08:00 · 1h 30m · Sentosa Air · Economy · Direct · Booking ID: ZEEBAW.\n\n**Design system**\n- **Styles:** 19 colour styles (the two brand colours, neutrals, text, surfaces, photo overlays, rating, error, disabled and a brand gradient), 10 text styles in Inter, and 3 shadow styles.\n- **Components** (frame `11:2`, placed below the screens):\n  - Language Selector, for use on photos or light backgrounds.\n  - Icon button, in default, pressed and disabled.\n  - Sign In button, in default, pressed and disabled. It's built on the 02 Button.\n  - Input, in empty, focused, filled and error. It's built on the 02 Text Field.\n  - Social sign-in button, in default and pressed.\n  - Tab Item, current and default, plus the Tab Bar.\n  - Category Item, in default and pressed.\n  - Search Bar, Section Header, Points Chip, Status Badge, Home header, Flight Ticket, Journey Card and Hotel Card.\n- The screens use instances of these components, the 02 status bar and home indicator, and the 04 logo, photos and icons.\n\n**Prototype**\n- 01_Splash goes to 02_Get_Started automatically after 2 seconds (fade).\n- \"Your Journey Starts Here\" opens 03_Sign_In (slides in from the right).\n- \"Sign In\" opens 04_Home (fade).\n- The Home tab is the current tab and has no link.\n- The flow start point is \"Travelin · Launch flow\", beginning at 01_Splash.\n- The icon button, Sign In button, social buttons and category items switch to their pressed state while held.\n- On 04_Home, the status bar and tab bar are set to stay in place while the page scrolls.\n\n**Remaining limitations**\n- **Prototype not played:** I checked the links in the file's data but didn't run the prototype. The tab bar is set to stay at the bottom while scrolling, which I expect Figma to honour, but I haven't seen it in Present mode.\n- **Device setting:** the prototype's device (iPhone, 430×932) can't be set through the tools I have, so please pick it in the Prototype panel.\n- **Entry-only items:** language selector, Forgot password?, social sign-in, Sign Up, search, categories, See all, the cards, the ticket, and the Orders, Deals and Account tabs have no links, as the brief says."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26,"cache_creation_input_tokens":90607,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":90607,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f8190a39-e47e-4328-bdb6-2ec5fd9db006","uuid":"a42a74c8-78e1-4535-9821-2b34caa87e74","timestamp":"2026-10-31T20:35:58.790Z"}
